label Greeting
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
Customer: Hello! This is a debug test for the debt system.
Customer: I want some [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Customer: Oh! I forgot my wallet. Can I get these on utang?
	- Sure, pay me later.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		Customer: Thanks! I'll be back another time to pay.
	- No, cash only today.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		Customer: Aww, okay. I'll come back when I have money.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
Customer: Still waiting for that {Transaction_ItemWants}!
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
Customer: This was a successful debt test!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
Customer: Hey! I'm here to repay my {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos.
Customer: Here you go. [signal arg="repay_debt"]
Customer: Debt cleared!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]
